  "title": "Bank OZK Announces Second Quarter 2026 Earnings",
  "summary": "LITTLE ROCK, Ark., July 21, 2026 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- Bank OZK (the “Bank”) (Nasdaq: OZK) today announced that net income available to common stockholders for the second quarter of 2026 was $163.3 million, a decrease of 8.7% from $178.9 million for the second quarter of 2025, but an increase of 2.5%",
